{"channelId":"UClWHyxw6y84sZMELua94ubA","row":["Charming Pet Rescue",91,"At Charming Pet Rescue, we focus on rescuing family-friendly dogs and cats—pets that are good with people and other animals. Many of our dogs play together in outdoor yards, where visitors can meet them in a relaxed, social environment.\n \nFounded in 2015, we’ve grown into a lifesaving team of staff, fosters, and volunteers who help rehome over 1,200 animals every year. About a third of our pets stay at the rescue, while the rest are in loving foster homes. Our facility is equipped with heating, A/C, and high-powered fans to keep animals comfortable during their stay.\n \nThanks to our dedicated team and community support, we’re giving more pets a second chance—and helping families find their perfect match.\n\nWe’re located in Boerne, TX and adopt out locally in Bexar county and the surrounding area. Check us out: charmingpetrescue.org","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClWHyxw6y84sZMELua94ubA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClWHyxw6y84sZMELua94ubA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:41.638Z","channelId":"UClWHyxw6y84sZMELua94ubA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"df638128155a8394ddbe655a2b1d740da4d9f2e80b967402f9a10ae2cd66f047","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7bcc4c6b30ef0d634a0bc9f97b40fcf4554a6aa9ddc55a9b0a47ccef5a904367"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClWHyxw6y84sZMELua94ubA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":91,"raw":"91 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClWHyxw6y84sZMELua94ubA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:41.638Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/